OL,3,AFed has 'work to do' if price rises
OL,4,Adon't ease for Americans, Warsh says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the US central bank has
OL,7,Fsaid policymakers will "have work to
OL,8,Fdo" if they were not confident
OL,9,Fcost-of-living pressures were easing
OL,10,Ffor Americans.
OL,12,FFederal Reserve chair Kevin Warsh said
OL,13,Fwhile inflation readings looked better
OL,14,Fthan expected over the summer, they did
OL,15,Fnot show that the current picture had
OL,16,F"meaningfully improved".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
