OL,3,AFed has 'work to do' if price rises
OL,4,Adon't ease for Americans, Warsh says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new Fed boss stressed that his
OL,7,Fremarks should not be treated as a
OL,8,Fguide for future interest rate
OL,9,Fdecisions, but the comments are a
OL,10,Fsignal rates could be raised if
OL,11,Fpolicymakers believe inflation is too
OL,12,Fhigh.
OL,14,FLatest figures show prices rose 3.4% in
OL,15,Fthe year to July, above the Fed's 2%
OL,16,Ftarget. Another inflation measure
OL,17,Fclosely watched by the Fed is running
OL,18,Fat 3.7%.
